ready1_open_rewrite.raw_answer_text:
\textbf{Solution:} Let the equation of line $l_{1}$ be $y=kx+b$. According to the problem, we have
\[
\left\{
\begin{array}{l}
k+b=0, \\
b=2.
\end{array}
\right.
\]
Solving these equations, we find
\[
\left\{
\begin{array}{l}
k=-2, \\
b=2.
\end{array}
\right.
\]
$\therefore$ The equation of line $l_{1}$ is \boxed{y=-2x+2}.

